'''Lizard Cat''' is the 8th [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]] unlocked. He is available after clearing [[Egypt (Empire of Cats)|Egypt]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 for 7,000 XP or via the [[Cat Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] increases health, damage and recharge time.

{{Cat Info
